[S5] E2's readout gauge is harmonic by law (friction breaks gauge invariance), so Theorem G's selection is not available.
     Harmonic-law per-mode coefficients (r198_modes.out [M8]: harmonic = Poisson + Delta, Delta prop. to (a-2)) at the complete split:
     spacelike: tau_00/u0 = -6*(a - 2)/((x - 1)*(x + 1)) ; tau_kk/u0 = -2*(a - 2)*(5*x**2 - 2)/((x - 1)*(x + 1)) ; zero at a = [2] / [2]
     timelike: tau_00/u0 = 2*(3*a + 2*x**2 - 8)/((x - 1)*(x + 1)) ; tau_kk/u0 = 2*(5*a*x**2 - 2*a - 12*x**2 + 6)/((x - 1)*(x + 1)) ; zero at a = [8/3 - 2*x**2/3] / [6*(2*x**2 - 1)/(5*x**2 - 2)]
     IR check, rho^2 coefficient of tau_kk, harmonic law: 2*a*x**2 - 5*x**2 - 1 (no x^4 term for any a)

[S6] E2 complete split: S-block powers P_E2 = P_E1/|R|.  rho power p1_E2 = 2 sqrt(D')/(1-x^2)^2, D' = (1-x^2)^2 + g^2 x^2:
     p1_E2 = 2*sqrt(g**2*x**2 + (x**2 - 1)**2)/(x**2 - 1)**2 ; near the cone (1-x^2 = y -> 0): ~ 2*g / y^2
     => int dx p1_E2 near the cone with an age cutoff |1-x| > 1/(c k t): ~ g c k t / 4 = gamma t / 4 (power law), on top of E1's ln(c k t):
        gamma t = 0.016 : excess S-channel record variance (units of the per-shell floor) ~ 0.004
        gamma t = 0.047 : excess S-channel record variance (units of the per-shell floor) ~ 0.0118
        gamma t = 1     : excess S-channel record variance (units of the per-shell floor) ~ 0.25
        gamma t = 100   : excess S-channel record variance (units of the per-shell floor) ~ 25
     so under P-r14b (t >> 1/gamma) the complete split is not record-finite at the cone; a cap in the band is a new datum.
     g=1e-03: int_0.5^1.5 tau_kk dx: uncapped -1.9980 (timelike -4|R| only: -2.0000) ; capped 0.3135 ; residual 2.3115 ; TT-only (trapezoid, coarse) 30.5 ; leading-log TT 4 ln(2/g) = 30.4 ; residual/(4 ln(2/g)) = 0.076
     g=1e-05: int_0.5^1.5 tau_kk dx: uncapped -2.0000 (timelike -4|R| only: -2.0000) ; capped 0.3115 ; residual 2.3115 ; TT-only (trapezoid, coarse) 49.0 ; leading-log TT 4 ln(2/g) = 48.8 ; residual/(4 ln(2/g)) = 0.047
     g=1e-07: int_0.5^1.5 tau_kk dx: uncapped -2.0000 (timelike -4|R| only: -2.0000) ; capped 0.3115 ; residual 2.3115 ; TT-only (trapezoid, coarse) 106.6 ; leading-log TT 4 ln(2/g) = 67.2 ; residual/(4 ln(2/g)) = 0.034
     extrapolated to record-noise g = 1.7e-31: residual/(4 ln(2/g)) = 0.0081
     extrapolated to record-noise g = 5.0e-31: residual/(4 ln(2/g)) = 0.0082
     extrapolated to record-noise g = 2.0e-35: residual/(4 ln(2/g)) = 0.0072
